Title: NSMB2 Randomizer

Summary: Randomizes the enemies of New Super Mario Bros. 2

Description: |
  Every level gets different enemies, driven by a seed.
  Press Select to open the menu with all settings.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
